          "title": "You'll want to know: व्यवहरति",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "व्यवहरति — vyavaharati — \"deals with people; behaves\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यदि सः विनयेन व्यवहरति, तर्हि जनाः तं सम्मानयन्ति। yadi saḥ vinayena vyavaharati, tarhi janāḥ taṃ sammānayanti. If he deals with people politely, they honour him."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): सः विनयेन व्यवहृतवान्, saḥ vinayena vyavahṛtavān."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "व्यवहरति (vyavaharati) is built on vi, ava and the root √hṛ, \"to take\"; MW gives vy-ava-√hṛ \"to act, to behave towards or deal with\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
